cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the report (preferred-citation); if you use the qsim simulator or the data, also cite the software."
title: "bp-from-scratch: a NumPy state-vector simulator and a reproducible study of barren plateaus"
abstract: >-
  A from-scratch NumPy state-vector simulator with exact parameter-shift and
  adjoint gradients, and a reproducible numerical study of barren plateaus in
  variational quantum circuits on 2-16 qubits: Haar references, cost-function
  and initialisation dependence, training under shot noise, QAOA and exact
  dynamical Lie algebras.
